6.The DNS Identity Crisis (CoreDNS
Issues)
**“DNS error → test with nslookup pod → check CoreDNS pods/logs → scale or increase memory.”**

**“If services can’t resolve DNS names, I test with a temporary pod using nslookup. 
Then I check CoreDNS pods and logs. If overloaded, I scale CoreDNS or increase memory and retest.”**
